        "original_id": "0f14fca9-c9e8-56c6-ae25-9262239d7104",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Qionghai, Suining, Hainan, Sichuan, Southwest China\n- Concepts: city status, county history, area, population, prefecture-level city\n\nFacts:\n- Qionghai is a large land area in Hainan that was formerly a county, despite being called a city.\n- In 2010, Qionghai had an area of 1,692 km2 and a population of 483,217.\n- Suining is a prefecture-level city in eastern Sichuan province in Southwest China.\n- In 2002, Suining had a population of 658,798.",
